## Admin Endpoints

- **GET** `/admin/customerDetails` — Get details of all customers.
- **GET** `/admin/deposits` — Get deposit history.
- **GET** `/admin/withdrawals` — Get withdrawal history.
- **PUT** `/admin/approve/{customerId}/{requestType}/{requestId}` — Approve a loan or credit card request.
- **PUT** `/admin/reject/{customerId}/{requestType}/{requestId}` — Reject a loan or credit card request.

